d the same rollback to v2.3.0, and it completed. This did not need change-manager approval because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The first create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. The incident was already there, so I did not create a duplicate and on-call was paged once. The summary covers the actions taken.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks before it is released again, and look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt.", "type": "text"}]}]}